# In Manus Cloud development and the published Node container, the platform injects
# MANUS_API_URL and MANUS_API_KEY into the server process. Do not add VITE_ prefixes,
# copy these credentials into the browser, log them, or commit populated values.
#
# Optional model override; omit to use the platform default.
# STORY_AI_MODEL=
#
# Local development outside Manus may set the platform-compatible URL/key in the server
# environment only. This app does not require a separate third-party AI-provider account/key.
# FFmpeg and eSpeak-NG are system packages; see README.md.
